体飞鹰式的造型流畅感。优雅凌厉的前脸设计整个前脸设计兼具力量与锋芒，LED大灯与大尺寸梯形进气中网完美契合，并与上部封闭式格栅组成贯穿式“飞翼”结构，气势十足，魅力非凡。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FtxRmZBlSwSoTtde0yWqOrQes7Z1.png"},{"t":"text","v":"投射式LED前大灯Hi级别大灯，外围包裹2条L型灯带，尽显凌厉。示廓灯/日行灯/转向信号灯三灯一体，转向灯点亮时切换为琥珀色，实现了独立性和功能性，内侧搭配投射式LED灯组，光彩夺目。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/Fvg4ZH3KOZMsMFBLt6fl9f_1Dv3e.png"},{"t":"text","v":"车灯光源功能分布"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FvgpYO4-68obnNhupK4KtlQWZQrU.png"},{"t":"text","v":"(上图均摘自网络)凌放上市一年来各大媒体对这款车的大灯报道不多，那么今天正好有机会对该车高配大灯进行分解，请各位耐心观看。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/Fjwxm9TogZUL7JpIofq5A99Gesqj.png"},{"t":"text","v":"灯罩为PC双色成型，热熔胶密封，90度烤箱放置半小时后出锅，将灯罩和灯毂分解。目测胶槽里涂胶较为均匀，两侧高度差不多，日后的行驶中应该不会有因为密封不严而进水的情况。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FuxUgnCjPjW5-BQYt7RvCV8J4g_h.png"},{"t":"text","v":"去除灯罩后"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FpJ0tYzAO5OXeF6l8BZaCrhhQPrH.png"},{"t":"text","v":"大灯内部结构，一包OZO干燥剂很多灯厂都喜欢用干燥剂，可是仅能使车灯从工厂到主机厂装车这段时间内部保持干燥状态，饱和以后就没有用了。。。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FkpCSDfVg8ugCSyZobMH3pJNuQFQ.png"},{"t":"text","v":"背面，散热片个头不小，负责转向灯/示宽灯/位置灯一体基板的散热，共计5个呼吸孔--车灯热量的交换通道"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FqXvQFPm8edsbglKObGazd7ahVF2.png"},{"t":"text","v":"背面HSG上标注了各发光单元的电压和功率"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FnrQOzuzqg5khSnpycfaho0dsch1.png"},{"t":"text","v":"同时也标注了各注塑零件的材质"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FvJnI99DViQXBwxcYoQdGQPseKh7.png"},{"t":"text","v":"呼吸帽一共5个，充分保证细长造型的大灯内外热量平衡，气压平衡。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FrgK1UwJseOFbKSH0fTDis8ET2c-.png"},{"t":"text","v":"AML的调光电机，负责大灯光型上下调整，较其他丰田系车灯调光电机体积小了一些进一步拆解灯框拿下"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/Fjoa9ROflXkOhdlgVw4p2fEzGzAH.png"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FsUZ7QZNNHOn6-Bzlg0WMvFFErVG.png"},{"t":"text","v":"松开螺丝，拆解灯框"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FuU7aP0lNu55LfP1P4Wy2epWbuH9.png"},{"t":"text","v":"其中除了光导使用两颗螺丝固定，其余均为卡扣固定的装配方式"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/Fu2NiSnz9_1KLSeyYIQgJJWNSUF6.png"},{"t":"text","v":"光导外灯罩为透明材质，不透光部分喷黑漆处理"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FsWRtvRJLEhWxtJBo1TsKq5xU2Fd.png"},{"t":"text","v":"明显喷涂痕迹"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FokFA1Hd4OjXa6MlJj-yjmkDvlmN.png"},{"t":"text","v":"回复反射器为超声波溶着"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FsarKn-nOykSqUFZ5LhJMxbk1spK.png"},{"t":"text","v":"转向灯/位置灯/日间行车灯一体基板，黄的是位置灯和日间行车灯的光源，琥珀色是转向灯的光源"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FockSSSSxHbd1TDWCLeQg8ciAkgL.png"},{"t":"text","v":"全部拆解，散热片足够大，有效保证日行灯常亮时的散热"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/Fu40rzxvOi4hjsaHkwlaWEB4I8X4.png"},{"t":"text","v":"辅助近光，LED+反射镜结构，LED采用三点热铆固定"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FlN9mgyEHr_m8ArSJIN1PiGQ-9Yt.png"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FrYbWSi7qQs1-skYdG7tXpBAxBta.png"},{"t":"text","v":"只有一颗LED芯片，发光功率应该不大，没有散热片护体"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/Fkfqr8O5fOmED08bw9PvPP-0mJeu.png"},{"t":"text","v":"反射镜 灯罩 LED 灯框"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FpKNIwSNU4VO5km4wjx5t0WpNv8L.png"},{"t":"text","v":"整灯的核心登场，自适应远近一体透镜 -----AHB系统的核心部件主透镜各视角图片"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FtIrmCQCWIm6LW8xsZjUCeFnBs9J.png"},{"t":"text","v":"插入介绍一下 丰田大灯的 AHB 自适应远光灯系统"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FnR-J1KHu8g6nLYx1a2EQuJZ4QXE.png"},{"t":"text","v":"好，话锋一转，继续拆解透镜支架 ，灯框，透镜，驱动器，线束"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FvvohFS3dP4HcNAOBiHBV7E6mqGa.png"},{"t":"text","v":"拆大线的时候，卡扣的设计我觉得不错，有一个嵌入式的楔子，确保安装插头牢固可靠"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FiyrYwyr7AXjIguoD48iD-U87Prx.png"},{"t":"text","v":"各模块部件均使用内梅花螺丝固定，拆解还要专用的批头"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/Fpf25b8ljbn-bLiDvelCwDUGvWMY.png"},{"t":"text","v":"透镜正面，中心一排微透镜"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/Fo_7stPAP2hOOjs46ICxe0RfN7qg.png"},{"t":"text","v":"内部 基板3颗LED 3个光导"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/Fn_CS6vThN_KtjbPedb7YOv9SqEb.png"},{"t":"text","v":"反射镜，反射出需要的光型"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/Fj5xNUfDdlmnaiULkOMkNGHrIiZt.png"},{"t":"text","v":"拆出内部光导，PC材质，透镜和明暗截止线一体成型，工艺不错，干净透亮，没有明显的缩痕熔接痕"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FiXrFn8wVJ_sgyE59EL0NNY-LJYQ.png"},{"t":"text","v":"全家福，主透镜的散热器也同样够大"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FgH-YXaUZUfyOuhaOO_BA1qms2UT.png"},{"t":"text","v":"近距离观察基板3颗近光LED"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/Fr2uQRfatNrRB07khDYGhZtbbTKR.png"},{"t":"text","v":"五颗自适应远光LED，根据路况关闭或点亮"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FpAAzMtzhXRtbLIFZxLpc523Cjv4.png"},{"t":"text","v":"远近一体透镜的驱动器，外壳全部为铸铝材质，确保良好的进行散热"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FuU6ggQ4OC6go-WXB0jVEGaPEaoT.png"},{"t":"text","v":"开盖，车灯“大脑”内部全貌展现无余，主要发热的芯片都涂有导热硅脂"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FoG94mj7ccoWmfeV1rfZ9ZwJFR6M.png"},{"t":"text","v":"电路板背面"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/Fi5mjGd_WqhwVjyYTXll9AyTSdmS.png"},{"t":"text","v":"辅助远光的供电模块，同样是铸铝壳体"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/Fv69HwJm5WGJCSlTG7qa-3tzeb34.png"},{"t":"text","v":"拆开内部"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FiBozFuIwitgBpt-DDLK-oKyUHXO.png"},{"t":"text","v":"至此整灯拆解完毕"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FkIvy-09nkP-qwoCqMYduUdn4B6w.png"},{"t":"text","v":"该车灯生产厂家为常州星宇，国内销售额第二大灯厂，产品线几乎覆盖中日德欧美全系。通过拆解可知，整灯结构不复杂，并未采用酷炫的技术，中规中矩，拆解较容易，零件的外观状态较为规整少有瑕疵，工艺良好，估计成本控制的也不错。文章至此完毕，感谢大家观看！同时感谢热心网友“农场追光者”的投稿。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/Flg3GCcSrHvXaqo3m_2449rJTd00.png"}],"coverImg":"https://cdn.dengdengschool.com/uploads/20230706/FtZVm0AEyKBxL9nddlp_TneX2xvm.png"}